  "body": "Our seller was drawn to this superb location and the lifestyle it offers, surrounded by quality amenities and a welcoming community. The home's thoughtful design provides year-round comfort, making it perfect for a well-deserving family.\r\n\r\nPlans have now been put on hold until the sale is complete, with genuine intent to remain in the area. A trade may also be considered.\r\n\r\nThere's flexibility around deposit and settlement terms to help create a smooth transition for the right buyer. \r\n\r\nSharp priced to sell! \r\n\r\nKey features :\r\n- Freehold!\r\n- Open plan kitchen and large living area!\r\n- Ample parking!\r\n- Top school zoning !\r\n- Great investment potential !\r\n\r\nAll agents conjunctional are welcome!",
